# Start by denying everything; Dockerfile sees only these reviewed source trees.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!backend/
!backend/**
!core/
!core/**
!ui/
!ui/**
!platform/
!platform/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!web/
!web/**
!docs/
!docs/THIRD_PARTY.md
!LICENSE
# Re-deny private or generated material inside allowed trees.
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.private.*
**/.env*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*client_secret*.json
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db*
**/*.ics
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/test-results/**
